OL,3,A'Postcode lottery' driving children's
OL,4,Ainequality in England, commissioner
OL,5,Awarns
OL,6,
OL,7,FHer report found that deprivation alone
OL,8,Fcould not explain the differences in
OL,9,Ftheir experiences. Some poorer areas
OL,10,Fhad scored highly in her analysis
OL,11,Fcompared to relatively well-off ones.
OL,13,FEducation Secretary Lucy Powell said
OL,14,Fthe government will make sure "no child
OL,15,Fis held back by where they grow up".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
