OL,3,AAustralian MP has critical injuries
OL,4,Aafter being hit by car in what PM calls
OL,5,A'deliberate act'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAustralian MP Helen Haines has been hit
OL,8,Fby a car in what Prime Minister Anthony
OL,9,FAlbanese calls "a deliberate act"
OL,11,F"This wasn't an accident - there was a
OL,12,Fdeliberate act, it would appear,"
OL,13,FAlbanese tells Australian media
OL,15,FPolice say Haines has been taken to
OL,16,Fhospital with "critical injuries" and
OL,17,Fthey're investigating whether it was
OL,18,F"intentional" - statement in full
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
