OL,3,AAustralian MP has critical injuries
OL,4,Aafter being hit by car in what PM calls
OL,5,A'deliberate act'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHaines was reportedly in a car park
OL,8,Fnear her regional office in Wangaratta,
OL,9,FVictoria, when she was hit by a 4x4
OL,10,Fvehicle
OL,12,FA 43-year-old man, from nearby
OL,13,FTarrawingee, was arrested at the scene
OL,14,Fby a passer-by - here's what else we
OL,15,Fknow about him
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
