OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAlberta heads to polls to decide
OL,4,Awhether to hold vote on separation from
OL,5,ACanada
OL,6,
OL,7,FMany of those who support separation
OL,8,Fsay the oil-rich province's economic
OL,9,Fgrowth has been stifled by the
OL,10,Fenvironmental policies of Canada's
OL,11,Fcentral government in Ottawa.
OL,13,FBut those who want Alberta to remain
OL,14,Fpart of Canada - who include Prime
OL,15,FMinister Mark Carney - have called for
OL,16,Fthe country to show unity in the face
OL,17,Fof external pressures.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
